WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:06,080
Over at the Zhenbao Pavilion, the shopkeeper, the person who handles the goods, and the delivery person can all check it out.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,230
No, it's not necessarily Zhenbao Pavilion's problem.

3
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:14,230
What the second aunt said was that it would be bad for A-yuan's reputation if it made a big fuss.

4
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:18,550
After all, he hasn't left the cabinet yet, so it won't sound good if word spreads.

5
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:22,030
Yes, but something like this happened in the house.

6
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:26,160
Someone has tampered with the hairpin today. Ming'er still doesn't know what it is?

7
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:29,160
This kind of thing needs to be investigated quickly.

8
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:35,580
The assistant door won, and he will summon her after she rests for a while.

9
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:38,495
It's better to bring this matter to the old lady's face.

10
00:00:38,495 --> 00:00:41,145
As long as I insist that it was Ms. Lou who did it

11
00:00:41,145 --> 00:00:44,060
Just lend the old lady's hand to get rid of her

12
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:49,060
Okay, since this matter has nothing to do with you, you can go back first, then Zhi Xi will retire.
